liated corporations referred to in that statement; (d) include a copy of any statements of disclosure filed by the Member under subsections 14(3), 15(1) and 21(3); (e) list the positions and corporations, trade or professional associations and trade unions disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(e); and (f) list any trusts disclosed under paragraph 21(1)(b.1). Robert Morrissey · Member of Parliament Declaration type Disclosure Summaries (Code) Disclosure date March 20, 2026 Regime Conflict of Interest Code for Members of the House of Commons Description Assets- Sole ownership of a cranberry farm in Tingish, Prince Edward IslandInvestment in Private Corporations- Significant interest in PFI Group 2017 Inc, a holding company in Tingish, Prince Edward IslandAffiliated corporationsAffiliate of PFI Group 2017 Inc:- Global Food Technologies IncActivities- President of PFI Group Inc- Co-president of Global Food Technologies Inc Disclosed on March 20, 2026","url":"https://www.ethicscanada.ca/en/public-registry/Details?declarationId=4ee0e89b-0122-f111-81a4-001dd8b72449"}],"other":[]},"lobbying":{"total":158,"first":"2016-01-27","last":"2026-10-06","byYear":{"2016":17,"2017":22,"2018":25,"2019":11,"2020":10,"2021":12,"2022":12,"2023":11,"2024":13,"2025":8,"2026":17},"topSubjects":[["Health",34],["Agriculture",27],["International Trade",24],["Economic Development",24],["Fisheries",24],["Environment",19],["Budget",15],["Consumer Issues",15]],"topOrgs":[["Maritime Fisheries Union",9],["Dairy Farmers of Prince Edward Island",7],["Canadian Aquaculture Industry Alliance",6],["Canadian Federation of Agriculture",6],["Canadian Association of Optometrists",5],["Chicken Farmers of Canada",5],["fisheries council of canada",5],["Canadian Cattle Association",4]]}}